1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,100
This kind of pagoda looks nine floors tall.
这类古塔·外看九层高

3
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,500
One in Guangzhou hides seventeen inside.
广州有一座·内里藏十七层

4
00:00:06,500 --> 00:00:09,000
Hidden mezzanines double almost every level.
层层夹层·一层变两层

5
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,500
It has stood 900 years — the city's oldest landmark.
矗立900年·广州最老地标

6
00:00:11,500 --> 00:00:14,000
A passing poet once gave the temple its name.
一位路过的诗人·给它取了名

7
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,600
Su Dongpo saw six banyan trees — "Six Banyans."
苏东坡见六棵榕树·题"六榕"

8
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:19,000
Locals still slip in to light incense.
老广得闲·入嚟上炷香

9
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:21,400
Colored eaves earned it the name "Flower Pagoda."
彩饰飞檐·人称"花塔"

10
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:24,200
★ Expert Tip: Climb at opening — the narrow stairs jam by mid-morning.
★开门就登·窄梯上午就挤

11
00:00:24,200 --> 00:00:26,800
Nine floors or seventeen — how many would you count?
九层还是十七·你数得清吗？
